### Customer Login

**Description:** Authenticates customer credentials (email & password) and returns JWT access & refresh tokens along with user account info.

**Matching App Feature:** LoginScreen / AuthController.login()

**Authorization:** `Public`

#### Headers
- `Content-Type`: `application/json`

#### Request Body Schema
```json
{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "customer-password"
}
```

#### Response (201 OK)
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "account": {
      "id": "64f000000000000000000001",
      "email": "customer@example.com",
      "displayName": "Customer One",
      "darkMode": false,
      "notificationPreferences": {
        "emailAlerts": true
      },
      "preferences": {
        "currency": "USD"
      }
    },
    "sessionId": "64f000000000000000000002",
    "tokens": {
      "accessToken": "jwt-access-token",
      "refreshToken": "jwt-refresh-token",
      "tokenType": "Bearer",
      "expiresIn": 900
    }
  },
  "meta": {
    "requestId": "request-id"
  }
}
```

